{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "414d7dcf-b9e3-8675-951e-2b3354f7c12c",
  "created_at": "2026-01-26T14:41:12-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ellen Tillinghast",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Greg Lombardi",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:37:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, Greg speaking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:37:33-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon, Mr. Greg. Good afternoon, and I hope you are well on this wet day. My name is Ellen Tillinghast. Thank you for answering the telephone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:37:45-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, Ms. Tillinghast. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:37:50-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, yes. So, I have a small shop, and we are renovating the inside. The snow came yesterday and then the rain today, so everything is slow, but the workers, they say we need a dumpster. On the street, in front. [pause] Sorry, one moment, I am cooking something on the stove."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:38:11-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:38:14-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I am here. So the dumpster, it will sit on the street, not on my property. Is there a permit for this? I do not understand if this is for you, or for another office."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:38:29-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, a dumpster on the street does need a permit. It's a street occupancy kind of thing. You're calling the right place to start."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:38:39-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Street occupancy. Oh. So it is not a building permit? The workers said building permit, and I thought, no, the dumpster is not a building."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:38:50-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, the building permit is for the work inside. The dumpster is separate. Two different things."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:38:57-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two different. Yes. Okay. Then I have another question, please. Must a licensed contractor be the one to apply? Or can I, the owner, apply myself? My contractor, he is a very nice man, but he is busy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:39:13-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Hang on, I'm gonna pull that up. Okay. For the dumpster, generally the owner or the contractor can apply. For the building permit for the inside work, that can depend on what kind of work it is, so I'd ask whoever's handling that permit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:39:32-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, the building permit depends, but the dumpster, I can do it? I am a little mixed. You said the owner or the contractor, for the dumpster."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:39:44-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct. Dumpster, either one. Building permit, it depends on the work."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:39:49-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, okay. Dumpster, either one. Building, it depends. [pause] I am sorry, the spoon, it is making the noise. I am stirring and it taps. You can hear?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:40:01-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear it, you're fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:40:04-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. So where do I go for the dumpster paper? Is it here at your office, in City Hall, or I do it on the computer? I am not so good with the computer."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:40:19-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can come by the counter and fill out the form, or I can have someone call you back with the steps. Which is easier?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:40:30-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A telephone call is better, please. My number is four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-nine-four."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:40:36-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-nine-four. Got it. Somebody'll call you back, probably tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:40:41-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tomorrow. Very good. And so, the dumpster permit, but also the other one, the building, I ask that person about the contractor. Yes? I have it right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:40:53-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You've got it. Ask about both when they call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:40:58-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Greg. God bless you and your family. I am still a little unsure, but I will ask them again. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:41:09-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Ms. Tillinghast. Take care."
    }
  ],
